age":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tabby has some shocking news for Haseo, and Shino’s precious data beings to disappear.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-06-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lwGhM1r3gKaI9B8yJeVowUSmizA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lwGhM1r3gKaI9B8yJeVowUSmizA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/13"},{"id":"401128","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haseo is devastated about his inability to prevent Shino from falling into a comatose state. Tabby has plans for a new guild, but its lack of members is troubling.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-07-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dKxdwT3OsFsEZSL5XeWNQj1ZAen.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dKxdwT3OsFsEZSL5XeWNQj1ZAen.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/14"},{"id":"401127","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tabby encounters two players who are new to The World. Later, she learns the secrets to leveling up, and Haseo embarks on a quest for revenge.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-07-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7Y772NpBToH0XJL2NiF8omi6YFt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Y772NpBToH0XJL2NiF8omi6YFt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/15"},{"id":"401129","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Phyllo attempts to comfort Haseo, who continues to agonize over his comatose friend. A dangerous new quest – and the promise of newfound power – tempts Haseo.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-07-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eWXW0x6MnCEzUkC3T4gKIXMQfTA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eWXW0x6MnCEzUkC3T4gKIXMQfTA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/16"},{"id":"401133","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tabby’s been worried about Haseo since his departure to the Forest of Pain. She expresses her concern to Subaro, who is instructed by Pi to follow Haseo into the forest. Meanwhile, Yata and Pi prod Phyllo for information about his relationship with Ovan.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-07-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/37pBECnrsiheMv8hLUI6NsI2Bt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/37pBECnrsiheMv8hLUI6NsI2Bt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/17"},{"id":"401131","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tabby is still struggling with her inability to help Haseo in the Forest of Pain. In the forest, Haseo grows frustrated with the ever-growing amount of monsters he must fight before going deeper, but his quest for more power may be his downfall.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6l4pIem6S2mpa3ugv1NWj8Ep5oB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6l4pIem6S2mpa3ugv1NWj8Ep5oB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/18"},{"id":"401134","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tawaraya returns unde the moniker “Tohta” to discover a gang of money traders has been flooding the market, creating high inflation. Despite his quest for secrecy, Tohta can’t stand back and let the money traders fleece innocent players, and decides to intervene.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l0pkuBvCQ9wmcYV0wi0S5vvNUMe.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l0pkuBvCQ9wmcYV0wi0S5vvNUMe.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/19"},{"id":"401132","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As Haseo’s search for information about Tri-Edge continues, his sanity begins to slip away, and in a murderous rage he kills several PKs. Yata and Pi are still on the hunt for Haseo’s factor. They send Subaro to retrieve it, but she can’t overcome Haseo’s manic strength.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8qogGRvRtN7nSLPFt6R3ip13S4c.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8qogGRvRtN7nSLPFt6R3ip13S4c.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/20"},{"id":"401138","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A mysterious new player, Midori, has started a “hit-me-if-you-can” service. Haseo, still in the grips of manic power, enlists her services in order to discover Tri-Edge’s whereabouts. Meanwhile, Tohka encourages Tabby to start her own guild.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/82hsC2FYh6nkNQqC1rBTdhFfe3R.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/82hsC2FYh6nkNQqC1rBTdhFfe3R.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/21"},{"id":"401136","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tabby starts a new healing guild, but so far they haven’t had much success. Tohka points out that their levels are way to low to help anyone, and demands they go out and raise them. Haseo finally makes an appearance in town, and Phyllo warns him about the dangers of being single-minded.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-09-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qowgqzotVRKT2140OXZSBHDBQlX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qowgqzotVRKT2140OXZSBHDBQlX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/22"},{"id":"401137","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haseo, consumed by a violent mania, will stop at nothing to find Tri-Edge, even it if means slaughtering any Player Killer who steps in his way. But while on his murderous rampage he’s left behind a trail of PK enemies who band together to stop him.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-09-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1GkYcEE6qqotuvzNSP231nqwatf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1GkYcEE6qqotuvzNSP231nqwatf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/23"},{"id":"401135","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After brutally slaughtering all the PKers, Haseo earns the nickname “The Terror of Death.” Still in the grips of insanity, Haseo refuses help or warnings from his old guild. But when Haseo finally encounters Tri-Edge, will he able to carry out his plan?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-09-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aC3eEYYa2sEdKE0iUOxYqXwglLS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aC3eEYYa2sEdKE0iUOxYqXwglLS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/24"},{"id":"401139","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"There’s been no sign of Haseo for several days now, and rumors swirl that he’s quit for good. In his absence, Tabby has a realization, and also discovers a new love interest! Meanwhile, Phyllo divulges something shocking to Tohta.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-09-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/STjbZznLqeiFmLyMYJn2zfGzW2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/STjbZznLqeiFmLyMYJn2zfGzW2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/25"},{"id":"401140","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Episodio 26","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haseo reappears after his hiatus only to receive devastating news about Phyllo. Tabby finally discovers the confidence to make her own decisions, and informs Haseo she has decided to become a nurse in order to save Shino. Now, Haseo is alone with only his memories to keep him company.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-09-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zNtVEw1EAtQWJfw4tolqwuZ6KWO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zNtVEw1EAtQWJfw4tolqwuZ6KWO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3/episode/26"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8864/season/3"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":179